---
description: Ask for the current edition evidence needed for this private editorial review.
args:
  goal: string
  desk: EditorDesk
returns: string
---
Form a read-only question preserving the user's actual editorial issue, the desk's assigned topic and intended reader. Ask for the current retained edition, original source evidence, supported briefing and material gaps. This question requests evidence only: explicitly exclude a local evidence note, scheduling changes, publication and reader changes because the outer editorial workflow owns its private review packet.
